1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,860
Max found a button

2
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,100
that printed free coins,

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,200
one press,

4
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,260
one coin,

5
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,520
so he held it

6
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:05,920
down.

7
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,600
Ten became a hundred,

8
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,140
then the machine upgraded

9
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,360
to express delivery.

10
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,060
Max tried to hit

11
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,080
stop but his hands

12
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:13,980
were already buried.

13
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,660
Mia paid one coin

14
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,560
to turn it off.

15
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:17,940
Max asked for a

16
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:18,160
refund.

17
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,840
The machine gave him

18
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:20,160
one.
